# Checkmarx One scan exclusions for CH-002 Node lab.
#
# Excludes node_modules from SAST scanning. The dependency code lives
# there but is not application code; SAST findings on transitives are
# noise that obscure the lab's deliberate vulnerabilities.
#
# Note: this file is read by some Checkmarx versions but not all.
# In the Checkmarx One UI, configure path exclusions explicitly:
#   Project Settings -> Scan Configuration -> Source Exclusions
#   Add: **/node_modules/**

node_modules/
**/node_modules/**
package-lock.json
